WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.283 --> 00:00:03.662
- So a couple weeks ago Chris
and I went to San Francisco

00:00:03.662 --> 00:00:04.996
to shoot some videos.

00:00:04.996 --> 00:00:08.250
While we were there however
we managed to stumble across

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:09.584
a Future Toilet.

00:00:09.584 --> 00:00:11.920
I had a great time
using the Future Toilet.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:14.548
- I used the Future Toilet
and it was a nightmare.

00:00:14.548 --> 00:00:17.851
("Quirky Countdown")

00:00:18.176 --> 00:00:20.220
But it's a toilet that
has a bidet built in

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.389
and also other features.

00:00:22.389 --> 00:00:23.265
I'm excited.

00:00:23.265 --> 00:00:24.558
I've never used a Future Toilet.

00:00:24.558 --> 00:00:25.684
This is big for me.

00:00:25.684 --> 00:00:27.436
- And Keith is infectious.

00:00:27.436 --> 00:00:29.813
You know his enthusiasm made me go,

00:00:29.813 --> 00:00:32.023
"You know I don't have to poop,

00:00:32.023 --> 00:00:35.068
