00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:36.612
- So of course I pull out my cell phone.

00:00:36.612 --> 00:00:37.947
But now I had to use the bathroom.

00:00:37.947 --> 00:00:39.938
I actually really had to use the bathroom.

00:00:43.553 --> 00:00:45.052
And then awesome.

00:00:45.052 --> 00:00:46.830
I'm done using the bathroom.

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:48.210
Now the fun begins.

00:00:53.547 --> 00:00:55.983
Oooh (laugh).

00:00:55.983 --> 00:00:58.014
All right, I see.

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:02.259
This is great.

00:01:02.259 --> 00:01:05.807
So it's like okay, I
get it, but I want more.

00:01:05.807 --> 00:01:08.101
You know, so I upped the
pressure a little bit.

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:11.230
I can go max pressure.

00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:12.856
I'm like full blast.

00:01:12.856 --> 00:01:14.357
This is great.

00:01:14.357 --> 00:01:16.777
This is amazing, I feel so clean.

00:01:16.777 --> 00:01:20.399
- So Keith probably told a story about

00:01:20.399 --> 00:01:22.407
how he warmed it up

00:01:22.407 --> 00:01:24.367
and tried to like figure things out.

00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:26.912
I just sat down and was ready to go.

00:01:26.912 --> 00:01:30.103
Once again, I did not have to poop.

00:01:30.103 --> 00:01:34.626
Max pressure so I guess I
just start it at max pressure.

00:01:35.919 --> 00:01:39.887
Ummm, oh God. Oh my God.

00:01:43.087 --> 00:01:43.765
- Ahh.

00:01:43.765 --> 00:01:45.555
- I feel so clean.

00:01:45.555 --> 00:01:46.556
- Oh my God.

00:01:46.556 --> 00:01:47.557
- I feel so clean.

00:01:47.557 --> 00:01:49.184
I think this thing goes forever.

00:01:49.184 --> 00:01:52.312
- Bzzzzz, and so it goes like bzzzz.

00:01:52.312 --> 00:01:55.190
And it's like oh, it
doesn't stop on its own.

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:58.026
It will just keep going
unless you stop it.

00:01:58.026 --> 00:02:00.195
So I'm sitting there with just water

00:02:00.195 --> 00:02:03.573
shooting out my empty (beep) hole.

00:02:03.573 --> 00:02:06.451
Um, not cleaning anything off of it,

00:02:06.451 --> 00:02:10.372
just penetrating me with water.

00:02:10.372 --> 00:02:11.456
Now here's the good part.

00:02:11.456 --> 00:02:16.044
