and I'm like well, okay,

00:02:16.044 --> 00:02:20.674
I guess I just got shot in
the (beep) with some water.

00:02:20.674 --> 00:02:24.886
I guess that was supposed to be relaxing.

00:02:26.454 --> 00:02:28.473
Huh, I guess I have to poop now.

00:02:28.473 --> 00:02:29.683
