water balloon in my (beep) hole.

00:02:32.686 --> 00:02:35.730
So I start pooping and
it's just a waterfall,

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:38.441
just water just comes out of my butt

00:02:38.441 --> 00:02:41.280
