00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:42.946
It's not really diarrhea.

00:02:42.946 --> 00:02:46.366
It's just like poop paste
like and it's like everywhere.

00:02:46.366 --> 00:02:48.618
- I feel clean. I feel refreshed.

00:02:48.618 --> 00:02:50.036
- And I don't even know what part of me

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:51.663
